// Keep context-specific warnings visible; move only known standing notes into details.
const standingNote=/^(NEC 2023 baseline:|The selected OCPD must|Enter the final design load,|Circuit configuration determines|One complete identical set|Raceway fill uses|General feeders\/branches|Cu EGC is|Minimum raceway is|Customer-owned general commercial|Provide a completed service load|Review NEC 230|Service grounding and bonding|Any neutral is assumed|Each complete set occupies|Parallel ungrounded and neutral|Maximum modeled total service|Use line-to-line voltage for three-phase|Ideal nameplate full-load|Use true power factor for the load|Balanced three-phase load;|Electrical input watts only|NEC Chapter 9 Tables|No cables, bare grounds|Approximate resistance-only|Typical 3% branch|A voltage-drop size|NEC 2023 314|Each standard device yoke|Mixed sizes, long unbroken)/;
