const protectionStandingNote=/^(Secondary conductor installation is an unverified design assumption\.|Maximum modeled permitted OCPDs are table limits|NEC 2023 baseline,|Only ordinary dry-type transformers|The design load is preadjusted|OCPDs are table-based candidates only|Phase conductors only\.|Use the lowest verified temperature rating|No NEC 240\.4\(B\)|[0-9]+ CCC per raceway are derived)/;
